  "details": "some world authors and staff are very mean and abusive. take the furry talk and chill for example. i was hosting a public group instance when one of there team members came in and teleported me to the banned area. they teleported me to the banned section of the world area where i wasn't able to teleport back it would even force me to teleport into that area after i rejoined the world which is my group instance.  so, i kicked everyone from my instance from that banned area, due to there abusive behavior. and then i opened another furry talk and chill group public instance after banning some of there staff after they used the ban panel on me in a instance they didnt own. i was very angry and they are still not allowed in my group instances. they would go far as to using alt accounts to ban me as well. breaking guidelines to evade bans.",
